  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-07-16T03:43:42.885Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Currently, FBT recalibration results in resetting your avatar. This can be inconvenient if you've set up a bunch of persistent states. Recalibration should just force the pose to T-pose and then calibrate with the current avatar state; if resetting the avatar is actually desired, there's already a separate option for that.",
